yd-purpose-analytics-name = Usage counts
yd-purpose-analytics-desc = Counts which screens are opened, without message content, to improve the service.
yd-purpose-analyticsTag-name = Analytics provider script
yd-purpose-analyticsTag-desc = Loads the provider's script in your browser, which sends data to that provider.
yd-purpose-assistant-name = Assistant
yd-purpose-assistant-desc = Sends the text you choose, after removing what your administrator excludes, to the configured assistant provider.
yd-purpose-push-name = Push notifications
yd-purpose-push-desc = Sends a content-free wake-up signal to your device's push service when new mail arrives.
yd-purpose-openTracking-name = Open tracking of mail you send
yd-purpose-openTracking-desc = Adds a tiny image to mail you send so you can see whether it was opened. This records the recipients' loads.
yd-purpose-remoteContent-name = Remote images in mail
yd-purpose-remoteContent-desc = Loads images from other servers when you allow it for a sender.
yd-purpose-integrations-name = Connected services
yd-purpose-integrations-desc = Lets connected services such as Nextcloud and plugins receive data you send them.
yd-purpose-telemetry-name = Load-time measurements
yd-purpose-telemetry-desc = Reports how long folders and messages take to open, without content.
yd-art22-title = Automated processing
yd-art22-logic = The assistant and search features process the text you give them with a language model or an embedding model to produce a summary, a draft, tag suggestions or a ranking. They work from patterns in text and can be wrong.
yd-art22-significance = None of these features decides anything about you by itself. They make suggestions that you accept or ignore, and they never send, delete or file mail without your confirmation.
yd-art22-review = You can switch each feature off below, and you can ask a person at this service to review how your data is used by filing a request in the section below.
yd-feature-on = On
yd-feature-off = Off
yd-feature-summarize = Summaries
yd-feature-summarize-desc = Summarises messages you select.
yd-feature-draft = Drafting help
yd-feature-draft-desc = Suggests reply drafts that you edit and send yourself.
yd-feature-grammar = Grammar and clarity
yd-feature-grammar-desc = Suggests corrections to text you write.
yd-feature-dictation = Dictation
yd-feature-dictation-desc = Turns speech you record into text.
yd-feature-search-semantic = Meaning-based search ranking
yd-feature-search-semantic-desc = Re-orders search results by similarity of meaning.
yd-feature-auto-tag = Tag suggestions
yd-feature-auto-tag-desc = Suggests labels for messages.
yd-feature-recap = Thread recaps
yd-feature-recap-desc = Recaps the main points of a conversation.
yd-feature-assistant = Assistant chat
yd-feature-assistant-desc = Answers questions about your mail and proposes actions that you confirm.
